==Summoning familiars==
There are 3 categories for [[Summoning familiars]] that would assist in high-level slayer tasks—Combat, [[Beasts of Burden]], and Healers.

Use of combat familiars like [[Nihil familiar|nihil]] ({{scm|Summoning|87}}) or [[steel titan]]s ({{scm|Summoning|99}}) can increase your experience rates. Nihils are only needed for particularly troublesome tasks such as airut and Kal'gerion demons, who possess high defence and low affinity values, as even the best equipment can still miss relatively often. Otherwise, steel titans should be used, as most monsters don't possess fairly high defence levels or low affinity values that would make it troublesome for their accuracy.

[[Beast of Burden]] familiars may be used at tasks where the additional inventory can prove helpful, such as ripper demons and camel warriors. Otherwise, [[magic notepaper]] should be used to cert drops from monsters such as [[airut]]. [[Pack yak]]s are incredibly useful for most slayer tasks due to their ability to bank up to 240 items per hour, and adding 30 spaces to the player's inventory to fill with extra supplies and carry loot.

