[[Legendary pets]] are by far the best option for those who want to make some money off of slayer without hindering their experience rates much. These pets have 3 incredibly useful [[Legendary pet#Abilities|abilities]]: Scavenge, Beast of Burden, and Slayer Finisher. The Scavenge ability picks up items after killing enemies with a 10-15 second cooldown. The second ability makes it act as a Beast of Burden when a pouch is used on the familiar. The third ability is for [[Nechryael]] tasks for automatic kills if [[Slayer points#Rewards|quick kills]] is not unlocked.

For most assignments, it is the most beneficial to use a [[Beasts of Burden]], for its ability to store valuable loot, and withdraw food and prayer potions, effectively extending trips before needing to restock. Higher level Beasts of Burden last longer and have more inventory slots. 

When extra inventory slots are not needed, healing familiars, e.g. [[bunyip]] ({{scm|Summoning|68}}) and [[unicorn stallion]] ({{scm|Summoning|88}}) or combat familiars, e.g. [[Ripper Demon (familiar)|Ripper Demon]] ({{scm|Summoning|96}}) and [[steel titan]] ({{scm|Summoning|99}}) can be used instead.

Quick ways of recharging [[summoning point]]s include the [[tribute stone]] near the [[Falador lodestone]], and the [[Altar of War]] in [[War's Retreat]].

==Prayers==
You should always use [[Turmoil]]/[[Anguish]]/[[Torment]] to increase your kills per hour. If you can afford them, [[Malevolence]]/[[Desolation]]/[[Affliction]] should be used as they provide greater bonuses. [[Soul Split]], whether constantly active or via [[Prayer#Prayer flicking|prayer flicking]], will serve as the "food" for a majority of tasks, negating the need to bring actual food, though a few should be taken for emergencies. 

For some tasks, notably dragons, you can use a [[bonecrusher]] in conjunction with [[demon horn necklace]]. This method negates the need for prayer potions during task. This can also be used with monsters that drop ashes via the use of the [[attuned ectoplasmator]]; though it will eat considerable profit due to the cost of [[ghostly essence]].

[[Holy wrench]] passively increases the prayer points restored from potions. This includes [[super prayer]], [[prayer renewal]], and [[super restore]] potions. The wrench can be worn in the pocket slot to save backpack space.

