===Ushabti===
[[Ushabti]] are used to trap the souls of Slayer monsters. They are available after achieving 99 Slayer. The filled ushabti can be taken to the [[Sunken Pyramid]] in [[Menaphos]] and placed in either the [[Chest of Souls]] or in a dungeon hotspot. As a result, a variety of benefits are available, including an additional 5% Slayer experience when wearing the [[slayer helmet]], and the ability to teleport to the pyramid via the [[Slayer Codex]].

